Adds a second table-of-contents format for ICU .dat packages ("CmnD"
formatVersion 2), produced by oven-sh/WebKit's icu/compress-data.ts. Item
bodies and their DataHeaders are unchanged from formatVersion 1; only the
TOC is re-encoded: full item names are factored into a directory-prefix
table plus one global pool of unique basenames (16-way front-coded), and a
sentinel data offset gives every item an explicit length. This removes the
redundant per-item "pkg/tree/" prefixes and the 7 copies of every locale
basename that recur across the locale trees (~81% of the TOC).

A stock ICU rejects formatVersion 2 with U_INVALID_FORMAT_ERROR instead of
misreading it; ICU's own tools never see this format (compress-data.ts
consumes a stock formatVersion-1 package and is the only writer).

--- a/source/common/ucmndata.cpp
+++ b/source/common/ucmndata.cpp
@@ -211,6 +211,132 @@
